1 0 obj<</Author(buckysbears \(DrZebra\))/CreationDate(D:20261101024039+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), other characters have brief appearances, Angst, Hurt/Comfort, Emotional Hurt/Comfort, Whump, Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD, Nightmares, Panic Attacks, Implied/Referenced Child Abuse, Hyper-Vigilance, Implied/Referenced Self-Harm, Emotional self-harm, Post-Canon, look the girls have had some rough lives, and i think now that theyre safe theyre going to be dealing with the fallout, But now they have each other, ANOTHER PERSON WHO UNDERSTANDS WHAT THEYVE GONE THROUGH, THE GIRLS WILL BE ALRIGHT, Oh and Also, Cuddling & Snuggling, because i couldn't be this mean and not let them cuddle a lot, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply)/ModDate(D:20261101024039+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(you or your memory)>>
