<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">you or your memory</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;They're safe now, they have to keep reminding themselves of that. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;They're safe now, so why are they always waiting for the other shoe to drop? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora's past continues to haunt them, but now they have each other, and they aren't letting go.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>buckysbears (DrZebra)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>other characters have brief appearances</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Whump</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Nightmares</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Panic Attacks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Child Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hyper-Vigilance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Self-Harm</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional self-harm</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>look the girls have had some rough lives</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and i think now that theyre safe theyre going to be dealing with the fallout</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But now they have each other</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>ANOTHER PERSON WHO UNDERSTANDS WHAT THEYVE GONE THROUGH</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>THE GIRLS WILL BE ALRIGHT</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oh and Also</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Cuddling &amp; Snuggling</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>because i couldn't be this mean and not let them cuddle a lot</rdf:li>
